    "sections": {
        "description": "The Career Development theme is designed for websites focused on coaching, professional growth, skill training, and personal development services. It includes structured sections for programs, workshops, testimonials, team profiles, blogs, and contact information. The layout supports responsive functionality, helping content display properly across desktop and mobile devices. Customization features allow adjustments to colors, typography, banners, and page layouts without affecting usability. The theme also supports podcast integration, service showcases, and call-to-action sections for sharing career coaching resources and learning materials. Clean navigation and organized content areas make it easier for visitors to browse information related to coaching sessions, training programs, and consulting services. Suitable for a life coach, agency, educational mentor, or marketing consultant, the theme provides a professional structure for presenting career-focused content and development opportunities."
    },
